{"3528430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beast Awakening", "steam_appid": 3528430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/b687be44ce071f40182f0edca0478d75.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Awakening</strong> is a turn-based, one-vs-many multiplayer game of deadly hide-and-seek, where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Nordic folklore, it draws you into a dark world where ancient creatures roam and the lines between right and wrong begin to blur. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/73bad9d559af0ed31d6a1600ed171dc1.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience exciting asymmetrical play, where Hunters cooperate to track and defeat the Beast, while the Beast uses stealth and cunning to evade and ambush the Hunters. Draft from a shared pool of Action Cards, each with different effects depending if played by Beast or Hunter - choose wisely, or arm your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/139bba5c3f706cd6902523078516f17a.poster.avif?t=1759258724\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/139bba5c3f706cd6902523078516f17a.webm?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/139bba5c3f706cd6902523078516f17a.mp4?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/92d77592079f39b7727d46b94d2bfae6.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Beast - stay hidden, deceive, and strike at the perfect moment. <br>Or team up as Hunters - gather clues, anticipate the Beast’s path, and take it down before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beast leaves traces, summoning minions, and revealing only hints of its movement.<br>Hunters must use strategy and teamwork to uncover and outwit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/affa6ef5db4117f12be2f4c7f0f2fbff.poster.avif?t=1759258724\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/affa6ef5db4117f12be2f4c7f0f2fbff.webm?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/affa6ef5db4117f12be2f4c7f0f2fbff.mp4?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/af90acc19dc2c50ab666fdea9cef1f34.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as diverse Hunters with unique abilities and team synergies, or embody the ancient and godlike Beast. Each role offers a vastly different perspective and strategy. Play unfolds in rounds with two actions per turn, so make them count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With varied scenarios and shifting objectives, two games will never play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/f72df510c6bf8ab26ad8e97ff0806da1.poster.avif?t=1759258724\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/f72df510c6bf8ab26ad8e97ff0806da1.webm?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/f72df510c6bf8ab26ad8e97ff0806da1.mp4?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/0b8414348aea68d4f259772c8e730544.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Released in 2023 and translated to 12 languages, the original board game Beast was a tremendous success, paving the way for two more expansions, Shattered Isles and The Great Hunt. Now is your chance to once again hunt...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dawn breaks. The hunt begins.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/c750d43eb05cf87567df9a10e05e176e.poster.avif?t=1759258724\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/c750d43eb05cf87567df9a10e05e176e.webm?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/c750d43eb05cf87567df9a10e05e176e.mp4?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/b687be44ce071f40182f0edca0478d75.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Awakening</strong> is a turn-based, one-vs-many multiplayer game of deadly hide-and-seek, where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Nordic folklore, it draws you into a dark world where ancient creatures roam and the lines between right and wrong begin to blur. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/73bad9d559af0ed31d6a1600ed171dc1.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience exciting asymmetrical play, where Hunters cooperate to track and defeat the Beast, while the Beast uses stealth and cunning to evade and ambush the Hunters. Draft from a shared pool of Action Cards, each with different effects depending if played by Beast or Hunter - choose wisely, or arm your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/139bba5c3f706cd6902523078516f17a.poster.avif?t=1759258724\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/139bba5c3f706cd6902523078516f17a.webm?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/139bba5c3f706cd6902523078516f17a.mp4?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/92d77592079f39b7727d46b94d2bfae6.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Beast - stay hidden, deceive, and strike at the perfect moment. <br>Or team up as Hunters - gather clues, anticipate the Beast’s path, and take it down before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beast leaves traces, summoning minions, and revealing only hints of its movement.<br>Hunters must use strategy and teamwork to uncover and outwit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/affa6ef5db4117f12be2f4c7f0f2fbff.poster.avif?t=1759258724\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/affa6ef5db4117f12be2f4c7f0f2fbff.webm?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/affa6ef5db4117f12be2f4c7f0f2fbff.mp4?t=1759258724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/af90acc19dc2c50ab666fdea9cef1f34.avif?t=1759258724\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as diverse Hunters with unique abilities and team synergies, or embody 